    "$t": "痟媽祖，mā ài bat媽祖魚！"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #333333; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: black; font-size: small;\">No.288（2018年3--月）</span><br />\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 細明體; mso-bidi-font-family: 細明體;\"><br />▍</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif;\">痟媽祖，</span><span lang=\"EN\">mā ài bat</span><span style=\"font-family: , serif;\">媽祖魚！</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">作者：易俊宏</span><span lang=\"EN\"> Ia̍h Tsùn-Hông</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">　</span><span lang=\"EN\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">逐家</span><span lang=\"EN\">lóng</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">知影舊曆</span><span lang=\"EN\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN\">23</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">是媽祖生，</span><span lang=\"EN\">mā</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">知影「</span><span lang=\"EN\">3--</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">月痟媽祖」</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">鬧熱活動。</span><span lang=\"EN\">M̄-koh</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">，逐家</span><span lang=\"EN\">kám</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">知影有一種魚叫做「媽祖魚」？</span><span lang=\"EN\">Tsit</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">個月</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">「台灣動物記事」就</span><span lang=\"EN\">beh</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">來介紹</span><span lang=\"EN\">hōo</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">逐家知！</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">若是講著生活</span><span lang=\"EN\">tī</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">鹹水內底</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">「食奶類（『哺乳類』）動物」，通常逐家</span><span lang=\"EN\">lóng ē</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">想著「海豬仔」；</span><span lang=\"EN\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">中華白海豬就是今仔日</span><span lang=\"EN\">beh</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">講</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">「媽祖魚」。按記錄來看，</span><span lang=\"EN\">tsit</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">種海豬仔活動</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">所在是西太平洋</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">熱帶範圍，</span><span lang=\"EN\">tuì</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">澳洲到中國</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">長江口</span><span lang=\"EN\">lóng</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">有伊</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">行蹤。</span><span lang=\"EN\">Tī</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">台灣西部，</span><span lang=\"EN\">tuì</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">苗栗到台南</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">將軍漁港</span><span lang=\"EN\">tsit</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">个範圍，有蹛一陣白海豬仔，「媽祖魚」就是討海人對</span><span lang=\"EN\">tsit</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">陣海豬仔</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">稱呼。因為冬天</span><span lang=\"EN\">khau--</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">來</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">九降風，到</span><span lang=\"EN\">3--</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">時</span><span lang=\"EN\">tsūn</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">已經無</span><span lang=\"EN\">hiah</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">透</span><span lang=\"EN\">--ah</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">，白海豬</span><span lang=\"EN\">mā</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">因為天氣變</span><span lang=\"EN\">khah</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">溫暖，就有</span><span lang=\"EN\">khah</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">濟出來活動</span><span lang=\"EN\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">機會；討海人掠準</span><span lang=\"EN\">in mā</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;\">是</span><span lang=\"EN\">beh</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 新細明體; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial;